OL,3,AMore flights delayed after hundreds
OL,4,Acancelled by air traffic control glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlight delays will continue on
OL,7,FWednesday after an air traffic control
OL,8,Fproblem in the UK cancelled hundreds of
OL,9,Fjourneys.
OL,11,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,12,Faffected by the disruption and tracking
OL,13,Fwebsite FlightRadar24 said up to 1,000
OL,14,Fflights were cancelled after a glitch
OL,15,Faffecting air traffic control provider
OL,16,FNats.
OL,18,FNats boss Martin Rolfe apologised,
OL,19,Ftelling the BBC there would be a full
OL,20,Finvestigation into what had gone wrong,
OL,21,Fafter the firm said resolving the issue
OL,22,Fhad taken "longer than hoped".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
